{"hymn":"S763","parent":"E930","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¿He de ir sin fruto alguno","subtitle":"Predicar el evangelio—¿sin fruto?","syl":{"n1":"¿He","n2":"de","n3":"ir","n5":"sin","n6":["fru","i"],"n7":["to‿al","m"],"n8":["gu","m"],"n9":["no","t"],"n10":"Que","n11":["pre","i"],"n12":["sen","m"],"n14":["te‿a","t"],"n15":"mi","n16":["Se","i"],"n17":["ñor?","t"],"n18":"¡No","n19":"le","n20":["lle","i"],"n22":["vo","t"],"n23":"ni‿un","n24":["tro","i"],"n25":["fe","m"],"n26":["o","t"],"n27":"Ni","n28":["ser","i"],"n29":["vi","m"],"n30":["cio","t"],"n31":"de","n32":["va","i"],"n33":["lor!","t"],"n34":"¿He","n35":"de","n36":"ir","n38":"sin","n39":["fru","i"],"n40":["to‿al","m"],"n41":["gu","m"],"n42":["no?","t"],"n43":"¿He","n44":"de","n45":"ver","n47":"a","n48":["Cris","i"],"n49":["to‿a","m"],"n50":["sí?","t"],"n51":"Con","n52":"el","n53":["tiem","i"],"n55":["po","t"],"n56":"mal","n57":["gas","i"],"n58":["ta","m"],"n59":["do,","t"],"n60":"¿He","n61":"de","n62":["pre","i"],"n63":["sen","m"],"n64":["tar","m"],"n65":["me‿a","m"],"n66":["llí?","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Hoy la muerte no me asusta:","Cristo es ya mi Salvador;","Mas sin fruto alguno verlo,","Esto sí me da dolor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Darle todo yo quisiera","De los años que perdí,","A mi Salvador los diera","Para Su deseo cumplir."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Sigue al día negra noche,","¡Trabajad cuando haya luz!","Para evadir reproches,","Trae las almas a Jesús."]}]}